<title>Sudan's civil war: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/sudan/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-sudan-2026-10-20T01:58:18.088Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 20 Oct 2026 01:58:18 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;The Sudanese army and Rapid Support Forces are intensifying drone strikes on civilian sites, including a livestock market in Khartoum, a market where 80 people were killed, and gold-mining areas in West Kordofan and near the Egypt border, causing dozens of civilian deaths. Recent attacks have also hit a market in southern Sudan and an artisanal gold mine in South Kordofan, killing children and many civilians. These strikes expand the use of drones from combatant targets to economic and civilian locations, increasing civilian casualties. The conflict remains between the Sudanese Armed Forces and the Rapid Support Forces. 4,680 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/oct/19/us-migrants-deportation-ukraine-sudan&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/10/1168612&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiV0FVX3lxTFBzZzcyUzRkTzRDQmVoMzRubDI1T19wakJySDZmejIxeHhhRGJyZC1RYVZ2MUVGYnJzWURzSjJLNTU5cTF3V2lXZVNoUEEyMlFqYTYtcm1RWQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxQajhUeWR4aHN2ZmNmN1c2VllJWExsNWdIU3dzeGxsSDlRU2xwaUw5NTg2Y2VydHJnbzdUSFRneVNNbURsM2YxakV1V3F2dlh6aVg1QXNYejBnd3FyQjlmLWM5cGZMVktjRDNXUzN2N1RmVFpXMWhYVkxzVDZwX3NCVnhWTl9HSGc2OUNEbGl0X21GelVVRDAxdDcwZnBxY0xXTUs4?oc=5&quot;&gt;AP News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMimgFBVV95cUxNVnRGWlhjWjFwQzdtaXg3eHJvLXpMeDE4cFduNmRYVTJmcGs3SnktM2VOX184a0V5MHBEa1FvNGZ0SjBjNzBlM2JMX1FIekotSnhmaVN3dFQtcUd2N0hNVm5VZmNac2ZjSUk5Y1p5by1pYjFIb2c0RVFCRERELWRuVktnUFZHNjc1R01aX2FvQjVsVkVDNVhJRU5R?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Guardian&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot